{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55785","headline":"十八郎殿下又送偈上国师兼请和师乃答之 · 神晏","name":"十八郎殿下又送偈上国师兼请和师乃答之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建化开遮假立名，无名之说亦难停。\n其中荐得非关识，朗月当空不自明。\n北京秀长称爲泽，南派传宗祖讳能。\n黄卷暂诠呼作性，教外须参有别行。\n（以上八首均见《古尊宿语录》卷三七《鼓山先兴圣国师和尚法堂玄要广集》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"神晏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}